				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				171,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps/Editor): Sync upstream to e94b4c4 with Agents window and SSH fixes\n\nUpdate the VS Code dependency submodule from 7c59d89 to e94b4c4. This sync incorporates significant stability improvements and feature enhancements for the Agents window and remote session management.\n\nKey upstream changes included:\n- **Agents Window Stability:** Fixed terminal lifecycle issues where hidden tool terminals were incorrectly disposed, causing chat agent tool pipeline errors. Resolved layout state persistence across reloads and corrected sticky header backgrounds.\n- **SSH & Remote Reliability:** Implemented keyboard-interactive authentication fallback for SSH hosts requiring 2FA. Added a watchdog mechanism to detect and recover from silently-dead TCP transports (half-open connections) after network changes or sleep, preventing indefinite hangs.\n- **Session Navigation:** Enhanced back/forward history to track active chat changes within sessions and restored layout state per session.\n- **Tooling & API:** Fixed `apply_patch` rendering as file edits, corrected terminal disposal ordering to prevent xterm addon errors, and enabled bracketed paste mode for agent host terminals.\n- **Configuration:** Renamed `extensions.supportSessionsWindow` to `extensions.supportAgentsWindow`.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The setting `extensions.supportSessionsWindow` has been renamed to `extensions.supportAgentsWindow`.\nRefs: microsoft/vscode#315523",
			"SHA": "efa3b8d9924e509a58d5515c2b3c6491f29b409b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-11T22:31:36Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				171,
				1
			],
			"Message": "sync(Deps/Editor): Update to 7c59d899 with Agents window improvements\n\nMajor upstream changes synced from VS Code:\n\n- **Local session type**: Introduces `LocalSessionType` for in-process chat sessions in the Agents window with working directory propagation through tools, prompts, and confirmations\n- **Agent host attachment support**: Images and blob attachments now round-trip through the agent host via snapshot files in session attachments\n- **Sessions navigation**: Back/forward session history with Alt+Left/Right keybindings and context keys\n- **AHP transport JSONL logging**: JSONL logging for AHP frames at transport boundary behind `chat.agentHost.ahpJsonlLoggingEnabled`\n- **Claude agent Phase 7**: Tool permission round-trip and interactive tools with `canUseTool` callback wired through to host\n- **Session restore**: Last active session restored on reload instead of new-session view\n- **Router timeout**: Auto-mode router decision timeout increased from 1s to 2.5s\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `extensions.supportSessionsWindow` setting renamed to `extensions.supportAgentsWindow`\nRefs: microsoft/vscode#315523",
			"SHA": "15e8be52ead8a1e5ac5c3facc7b99d2a09ee64db"
		},
